Subject: [PATCH] Course character counts on demand: GET
 /courses/:courseId/characters

English characters (parsed segments + unparsed scripts) and, per language,
translation done/remaining (English chars, what DeepL bills) and audio
done/remaining (spoken chars, what ElevenLabs bills; untranslated audio
estimated with the language's expansion ratio). Nothing stored.

